lockd (1.0.2+parrot1) echo; urgency=medium

  * Initial ParrotSec packaging (debhelper structure).
  * Split into lockd (core, CLI, TUI, modules, helper, policy) and
    lockd-gtk (GTK4/libadwaita graphical interface).
  * Modules and profiles installed to /usr/lib/lockd/ (FHS root-owned
    path validated by the privileged helper).
  * Privileged helper installed to /usr/libexec/lockd/lockd-helper.

